# AWS SAM Cloud Architecture Project

This folder contains a minimal AWS Serverless Application Model (SAM) project for a simple Lambda API.

## Structure
- template.yaml: SAM infrastructure definition
- src/main.py: Lambda handler
- samconfig.toml: deployment settings
- events/get-event.json: sample event for local testing

## Commands
1. Build the project:
   sam build

2. Run locally with a sample event:
   local invoke HelloWorldFunction --event events/get-event.json

3. Deploy to AWS:
   sam deploy --guided

## Next steps
- Add DynamoDB or S3 resources
- Connect the Lambda to API Gateway or EventBridge
- Add IAM permissions and environment variables for production



## Data format notes
Data:
PostgreSQL:
- User account data
- User friends (bridge table between Users and users)

Dynamo:
- channels
{
   "channelID" : String
   "channelName" : String
   "messages" : 
   [
      "messageID" : String
      "userID" : String
      "message" : String
      "timeStamp" : String
   ]
}



## Endpoint format
# Users:

GetAllUsers
- GET
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/users

SignUpUser
- POST
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/users/create
- Body : {"username" : "", "email" : "", "password" : ""}

UpdateUser
- PUT
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/users/{user_id}
- Body : {*"username" : "", *"email" : "", *"password" : ""} - all are optional, but at least one needs to exist
- NOTE (A little concerned about how the password is handled. the password option directly send in to the encrypted password. The encryption algorithm is not in the lambda)

DeleteUser
- DELETE
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/users/{user_id}

Login
- POST
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/users
- Body : {"username" : "", "password" : ""}
- NOTE (Couldn't get this function to work, looks like the issue is within the encryption/decryption algorithm)

# Channels:
GetAllChannels
- GET
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel

GetChannelByID
- GET
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel/{channel_id}

GetChannelsByUser
- GET
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel/user/{user_id}

DeleteChannel
- DELETE
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel/{channel_id}

CreateChannel
- POST
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel
- Body : { "name" : "", "admin" : "", "people" : [""]}

UpdateChannel
- PUT
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel/{channel_id}
- Body : { "name" : ""}

AddUserToChannel
- PUT
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/channel/user/add/{user_id} 
