# Messages
GetMessagesByBatch
- GET
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/messages/get/{channel_id}/{message_batch_number}

DeleteMessage
- DELETE
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/messages/delete/{channel_id}/{sort_key}
- NOTE (the sort key being included in this function is for technical needs, the Dynamo format doesn't work without it)

CreateMessage
- POST
- https://1jgsq1z4h9.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Prod/api/messages/post
